<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>文档 on Go 中文档集</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/</link><description>Recent content in 文档 on Go 中文档集</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Oct 2024 15:07:50 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>关于 go 命令</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/AboutTheGoCommand/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/AboutTheGoCommand/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="about-the-go-command---关于-go-命令">About the go command - 关于 go 命令&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#about-the-go-command---%e5%85%b3%e4%ba%8e-go-%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/articles/go_command">https://go.dev/doc/articles/go_command&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	Go 发行版包含一个名为 &amp;ldquo;&lt;code>go&lt;/code>&amp;ldquo;的命令，该命令自动下载、构建、安装和测试Go包和命令。本文讨论了我们为什么编写了一个新的命令，它是什么，它不是什么，以及如何使用它。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 代码审查意见</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/CodeReviewComments/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/CodeReviewComments/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-code-review-comments---go代码审查意见">Go Code Review Comments - Go代码审查意见&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-code-review-comments---go%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81%e5%ae%a1%e6%9f%a5%e6%84%8f%e8%a7%81" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/CodeReviewComments">https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/CodeReviewComments&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>Ian Lance Taylor edited this page 12 days ago · &lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/CodeReviewComments/_history">101 revisions&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>This page collects common comments made during reviews of Go code, so that a single detailed explanation can be referred to by shorthands. This is a laundry list of common mistakes, not a comprehensive style guide.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	本页收集了审查Go代码时的常见评论，以便通过速记法来参考单一的详细解释。这是一份常见错误的清单，而不是一份全面的风格指南。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>数据竞争检测器</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/DataRaceDetector/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/DataRaceDetector/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="data-race-detector---数据竞争检测器">Data Race Detector - 数据竞争检测器&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#data-race-detector---%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%ab%9e%e4%ba%89%e6%a3%80%e6%b5%8b%e5%99%a8" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/articles/race_detector">https://go.dev/doc/articles/race_detector&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="简介">简介&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>​	数据竞争是并发系统中最常见和最难以调试的错误类型之一。当两个 Goroutine 并发访问同一个变量并且至少一个访问是写入操作时，就会发生数据竞争。有关详情，请参见&lt;a href="../References/TheGoMemoryModel">《Go 内存模型》&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>使用GDB调试 Go 代码</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/DebuggingGoCodeWithGDB/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/DebuggingGoCodeWithGDB/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="debugging-go-code-with-gdb---使用gdb调试-go-代码">Debugging Go Code with GDB - 使用GDB调试 Go 代码&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#debugging-go-code-with-gdb---%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8gdb%e8%b0%83%e8%af%95-go-%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/gdb">https://go.dev/doc/gdb&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	下面的说明适用于标准工具链(gc Go编译器和工具)。Gccgo具有原生的gdb支持。&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>​	​请注意，在使用标准工具链构建的Go程序进行调试时，&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-delve/delve">Delve&lt;/a>是比GDB更好的选择。它比GDB更好地理解Go运行时、数据结构和表达式。Delve目前支持Linux、OSX和Windows的amd64平台。有关支持的最新平台列表，请参阅&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-delve/delve/tree/master/Documentation/installation">Delve文档&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 1和Go程序的未来</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/Go1AndTheFutureOfGoPrograms/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:26:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/Go1AndTheFutureOfGoPrograms/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-1-and-the-future-of-go-programs---go-1和go程序的未来">Go 1 and the Future of Go Programs - Go 1和Go程序的未来&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-1-and-the-future-of-go-programs---go-1%e5%92%8cgo%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f%e7%9a%84%e6%9c%aa%e6%9d%a5" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/go1compat">https://go.dev/doc/go1compat&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="简介">简介&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>​	Go 1版本的发布，简称Go 1，是该语言发展的一个重要里程碑。Go 1是一个稳定的平台，有利于用Go编写的程序和项目的发展。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 文档注释</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoDocComments/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:26:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoDocComments/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-doc-comments---go-文档注释">Go Doc Comments - Go 文档注释&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-doc-comments---go-%e6%96%87%e6%a1%a3%e6%b3%a8%e9%87%8a" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/comment">https://go.dev/doc/comment&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	&amp;ldquo;Doc comments&amp;quot;是指出现在顶级package、const、func、type和var声明前的注释，中间没有换行。每个导出的（大写的）名称都应该有一个文档注释。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 发布周期(v18)</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoReleaseCycle18/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:26:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoReleaseCycle18/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-release-cycle---go-发布周期">Go Release Cycle - Go 发布周期&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-release-cycle---go-%e5%8f%91%e5%b8%83%e5%91%a8%e6%9c%9f" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle">https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>Ian Lance Taylor edited this page on Jun 29 · &lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle/_history">18 revisions&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	本维基页面由Go团队维护。请向 golang-dev &lt;a href="https://groups.google.com/group/golang-dev">发送评论&lt;/a>或&lt;a href="https://go.dev/issue">提交问题&lt;/a>，而不是直接进行修改。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	短链接：https://go.dev/s/release。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 发布周期(v20)</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoReleaseCycle20/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:26:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoReleaseCycle20/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-release-cycle">Go Release Cycle&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-release-cycle" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle">https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>Heschi Kreinick edited this page last week · &lt;a href="https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Go-Release-Cycle/_history">20 revisions&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	本维基页面由Go团队维护。请向 golang-dev &lt;a href="https://groups.google.com/group/golang-dev">发送评论&lt;/a>或&lt;a href="https://go.dev/issue">提交问题&lt;/a>，而不是直接进行修改。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	短链接：https://go.dev/s/release。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="概述">概述&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e6%a6%82%e8%bf%b0" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>​	Go每六个月发布一个版本。每个发布周期都分为大约4个月的开发阶段，然后是为期3个月的测试和打磨阶段，称为发布冻结期。如果一切顺利，下一个版本的工作将在上一个版本发布之前开始，导致大约一个月的重叠。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 模块镜像、索引和校验数据库</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/proxyGolangOrg/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/proxyGolangOrg/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-module-mirror-index-and-checksum-database---go-模块镜像索引和校验数据库">Go Module Mirror, Index, and Checksum Database - Go 模块镜像、索引和校验数据库&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-module-mirror-index-and-checksum-database---go-%e6%a8%a1%e5%9d%97%e9%95%9c%e5%83%8f%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e5%92%8c%e6%a0%a1%e9%aa%8c%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e5%ba%93" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://proxy.golang.org/">https://proxy.golang.org/&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	Go团队正在提供以下由谷歌运行的服务：用于加速Go模块下载的模块镜像，用于发现新模块的索引，以及用于验证模块内容的全局go.sum数据库。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 汇编器速成指南</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/AQuickGuideToGosAssembler/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 17:31:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/AQuickGuideToGosAssembler/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="a-quick-guide-to-gos-assembler---go汇编器速成指南">A Quick Guide to Go&amp;rsquo;s Assembler - Go汇编器速成指南&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#a-quick-guide-to-gos-assembler---go%e6%b1%87%e7%bc%96%e5%99%a8%e9%80%9f%e6%88%90%e6%8c%87%e5%8d%97" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/asm">https://go.dev/doc/asm&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="a-quick-guide-to-gos-assembler---go汇编器速成指南-1">A Quick Guide to Go&amp;rsquo;s Assembler - Go汇编器速成指南&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#a-quick-guide-to-gos-assembler---go%e6%b1%87%e7%bc%96%e5%99%a8%e9%80%9f%e6%88%90%e6%8c%87%e5%8d%97-1" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>This document is a quick outline of the unusual form of assembly language used by the &lt;code>gc&lt;/code> Go compiler. The document is not comprehensive.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	本文档是gc Go编译器使用的不寻常汇编语言的快速概述。本文档并不全面。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>FAQ</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/FAQ/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 16:56:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/FAQ/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="frequently-asked-questions-faq">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#frequently-asked-questions-faq" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/faq">https://go.dev/doc/faq&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="origins-起源">Origins 起源&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#origins-%e8%b5%b7%e6%ba%90" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="what-is-the-purpose-of-the-project-这个项目的目的是什么">What is the purpose of the project? 这个项目的目的是什么？&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#what-is-the-purpose-of-the-project-%e8%bf%99%e4%b8%aa%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e7%9a%84%e7%9b%ae%e7%9a%84%e6%98%af%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>​	在Go诞生的时候，也就是十年前，编程世界与今天不同。生产软件通常是用C++或Java编写的，GitHub还不存在，大多数计算机还不是多处理器，除了Visual Studio和Eclipse之外，几乎没有什么IDE或其他高级工具可用，更不用说在互联网上免费使用了。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>FAQ（中英对照）</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/FAQ_En_Zh/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 16:56:22 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/FAQ_En_Zh/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="frequently-asked-questions-faq">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#frequently-asked-questions-faq" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/faq">https://go.dev/doc/faq&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="origins-起源">Origins 起源&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#origins-%e8%b5%b7%e6%ba%90" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="what-is-the-purpose-of-the-project-这个项目的目的是什么">What is the purpose of the project? 这个项目的目的是什么？&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#what-is-the-purpose-of-the-project-%e8%bf%99%e4%b8%aa%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e7%9a%84%e7%9b%ae%e7%9a%84%e6%98%af%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>At the time of Go&amp;rsquo;s inception, only a decade ago, the programming world was different from today. Production software was usually written in C++ or Java, GitHub did not exist, most computers were not yet multiprocessors, and other than Visual Studio and Eclipse there were few IDEs or other high-level tools available at all, let alone for free on the Internet.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Go 工具链</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoToolchains/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Aug 2023 22:53:42 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoToolchains/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="go-toolchains---go-工具链">Go Toolchains - Go 工具链&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#go-toolchains---go-%e5%b7%a5%e5%85%b7%e9%93%be" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/toolchain">https://go.dev/doc/toolchain&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="简介">简介&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Starting in Go 1.21, the Go distribution consists of a &lt;code>go&lt;/code> command and a bundled Go toolchain, which is the standard library as well as the compiler, assembler, and other tools. The &lt;code>go&lt;/code> command can use its bundled Go toolchain as well as other versions that it finds in the local &lt;code>PATH&lt;/code> or downloads as needed.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>